Congratulations on completing your registration for <%= @team.race.name %>

Team: <%= @team.name %><% if @team.assigned_team_number.present? %> (Team #<%= @team.assigned_team_number %>)<% end %>

Racers:
<% @team.people.each do |p| %>
- <%= p.first_name %> <%= p.last_name %>
<% end %>

You can update your team information at <%= RegistrationUi.team_url(@team) %>
until <%= deadline_readable(@team.race.local(@team.race.registration_close)) %>, when registration closes.

<% if @team.race.confirmation_text.present? %>
<%= raw @team.race.confirmation_text %>

<% end %>
<% if @team.race.classy_campaign_id.present? %>
<% if @team.classy_fundraising_url %>
Your fundraising page: <%= @team.classy_fundraising_url %>
<% else %>
Your fundraising page is being set up; watch for a separate email.
<% end %>

<% end %>
Problems? Email dogtag@chiditarod.org

glory,
-- dogtag bot
